neither complete graphs of order 3 nor independent sets of order 10. 
And to resolve these limitations, a special mathematic al model is put in the 
paradigm to convert the problems into discrete  optimization whose smaller 
minimizers are correspondent to bigger lower bound as approximation of 
R(3,10)’s infimum as following flowchart1 shows. And the whole mathematical 
model will be interpreted in this Section in detail. 
 
