  ✓ Inspect repository harness contracts and comparable generators
  ✓ Implement and verify the generator, or write a reviewable rejection
  ✓ Run mandatory self-tests and the hardening/G9 harnesses if applicable
  ✓ Write final machine-readable deliverables and README or REJECTED.md
